  "slug": "gochujang-hummus-recipe-11699850",
  "name": "Gochujang Hummus",
  "recipe_type": "appetizer",
  "brief_description": "Gochujang Hummus is a bold and flavorful twist on classic hummus, blending the creamy richness of chickpeas with the deep, spicy-sweet heat of Korean gochujang.",
  "cuisine": "Middle Eastern Korean",
  "instructions": [
    {
      "position": 1,
      "text": "Combine chickpeas, tahini, olive oil, gochujang, lemon juice, garlic, and salt in the bowl of a food processor; pulse until coarsely blended. Scrape down the sides of the blender. Stream reserved chickpea liquid into the mixture as it blends until desired consistency is achieved."
    }
  ],
